/* 欠款页：手机端合计卡 + 往来行；电脑版微信大屏（>=768px）应收/应付并排双栏 */
.debt-mobile {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 24rpx;
}

.dsum {
  padding: 28rpx;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.dsum__k {
  display: block;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--mu);
}

.dsum__v {
  display: block;
  font-size: 52rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.dsum__n {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--mu);
}

.al {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
  padding: 26rpx 24rpx;
  border-top: 2rpx solid var(--ln);
}

.al:first-child {
  border-top: 0;
}

.al:active {
  background: var(--acs);
}

.al__l {
  min-width: 0;
  flex: 1;
}

.al__name {
  display: block;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 30rpx;
}

.al__sub {
  display: block;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--mu);
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.al__amt {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* 电脑版微信大屏（>=768px）：KPI 汇总条 + 应收/应付左右并排 */
.debt-desktop {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 16px;
}

.debt-kpis {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  padding: 16px 8px;
}

.debt-kpi {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 0 12px;
}

.debt-kpi + .debt-kpi {
  border-left: 1px solid var(--ln);
}

.debt-kpi__k {
  display: block;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--mu);
}

.debt-kpi__v {
  display: block;
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-top: 4px;
  color: var(--wn);
}

.debt-kpi__v--out {
  color: var(--ink);
}

.debt-cols {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  align-items: start;
}

.debt-col__head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 14px 20px;
  background: #f7f3ea;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ln);
}

.debt-col__title {
  font-family: 'Songti SC', 'Noto Serif SC', serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.debt-col__meta {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--mu);
}

.al-desk {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 13px 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ln);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.al-desk:first-of-type {
  border-top: 0;
}

.al-desk:hover {
  background: #faf6ee;
}

.al-desk .al__name {
  font-size: 15px;
}

.al-desk .al__sub {
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.al-desk .al__amt {
  font-size: 16px;
}

.al-desk__btns {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.al-btn {
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--ln);
  background: var(--sf);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  white-space: nowrap;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.al-btn--main {
  background: var(--acs);
  border-color: #eabaa0;
  color: var(--act);
}
